Font,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布Claude Opus 5.5模型：成本降40%且编程能力领先GPT-6Astra</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Sol 与 Luna 模型，API 价格腰斩并优化编程性能</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2b197fe7f34b2a76ffe074fd7b193b08.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 正式发布 GPT-6 系列新模型 GPT-6 Sol 与 GPT-6 Luna，旨在以更低成本提供接近 GPT-6 Astra 的专业性能。两款模型的 API 价格较 GPT-5.6 降低 50%，并引入优化后的提示缓存以提升上下文重用效率。在性能方面，GPT-6 Sol 在 AutomationBench 业务流程测试中表现优于 Claude Opus 5，且成本仅为其 9%；在 DeepSWE v1.1 软件工程测试中，Sol 取得 68.8% 的成绩，单任务成本降低约 80%。此外，两款模型针对 AI Coding Agent 工作负载深度优化，事实可靠性提升，且沟通风格更简练。目前，GPT-6 Sol 与 Luna 已在 ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 中向 Plus、Pro、B</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek受邀向联合国安理会进行AI潜在风险与安全挑战闭门通报</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96e1a439272c9263333d3cd96c192d9c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">中国人工智能初创企业DeepSeek预计将于本周向联合国安理会进行专题通报，重点阐述人工智能技术发展带来的潜在风险与安全挑战。此次闭门通报标志着国际社会对中国大模型企业在技术治理、风险防控及全球AI安全框架建设中作用的重视。随着AI技术迭代不断刷新边界，如何平衡技术创新与安全红线已成为全球多边治理机制的当务之急。DeepSeek此次受邀分享其对AI风险的研判与实践，为国际社会提供了来自中国科技企业的技术观察视角，反映出全球AI治理正加速向多边协作与深度对话阶段迈进。除DeepSeek外，包括阿里巴巴支持的月之暗面在内的多家中国AI企业也正积极参与全球范围内的通用人工智能长远挑战探讨，共同推动构建更具包容性的国际AI安全治理体系。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布Claude Opus 5.5模型：成本降40%且编程能力领先GPT-6Astra</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0bc19e8d5c77782b01d62f0e2d95bcf9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于9月23日发布Claude 5.5系列首款模型Opus 5.5，在提升性能的同时显著优化成本与效率。该模型默认任务成本较Opus 5降低40%，输出速度提升超30%。在9项基准测试中，Opus 5.5在7项中领先Fable 5.1及OpenAI的GPT-6Astra，尤其在编程领域表现突出，Terminal-Bench 4.0、FrontierCode v1.1及CursorBench 4.0均获最高分。长任务处理能力大幅增强，如在HAProxy从C语言到Rust的改写任务中，成本较Fable 5.1降低51%。定价方面，输入与输出Token收费分别为每百万4美元和20美元，缓存读取成本降低60%。安全层面，模型提示词注入防御成功率显著提升，且具备更强的自我报告能力。目前Opus 5.5已上</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
